in-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">联系电话</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">:本科生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">院综合</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">科</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">81891769</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">电子邮箱</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">:bksy@mail.xidian.edu.cn</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="margin-right: 42pt; text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">本科生院</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> &nbsp; </span></p><p style="margin-right: 42pt; text-align: right; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">202</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></article></section>
